          "snippet": {
            "line": 146,
            "text": "theorem pressure_moment {p g : ℝ → ℝ} (hp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ p)\n    (hs : HasCompactSupport p) (hd : ∀ r, deriv p r = g r) :\n    moment 1 p = -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * moment 2 g"
